        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will get the most scores and open many treasure chest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chest! Gotcha!&quot; is an online action game with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the field and open treasure chests!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure chests are placed on top of buildings as well as inside them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb up the crates and steps on the field to find the treasure chests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use power-up items! You can also disturb your rivals to use them!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items to open treasure chests faster than your rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use one of them and take scores from the rival you bump into!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can get high scores in the &quot;Treasure Area&quot;!?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bonus area “Treasure Area”, which appears at the end of play, is full of treasure chests! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go there in a hurry before other players open the treasure chests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOT function included! You can play with up to 4 players at any time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy playing online match with people around the world! You can also play alone with BOT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Epic Online Service is used to play online matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will get the most scores and open many treasure chest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chest! Gotcha!&quot; is an online action game with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the field and open treasure chests!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure chests are placed on top of buildings as well as inside them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb up the crates and steps on the field to find the treasure chests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use power-up items! You can also disturb your rivals to use them!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items to open treasure chests faster than your rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use one of them and take scores from the rival you bump into!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can get high scores in the &quot;Treasure Area&quot;!?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bonus area “Treasure Area”, which appears at the end of play, is full of treasure chests! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go there in a hurry before other players open the treasure chests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOT function included! You can play with up to 4 players at any time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy playing online match with people around the world! You can also play alone with BOT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Epic Online Service is used to play online matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
